{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "file:web/js/replay.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "replay.js",
      "filePath": "web/js/replay.js",
      "summary": "日志回放面板：打开只拉元信息（首尾时间戳/总行数/时长），播放按 2000 行分页拉取，进度条拖动走后端二分定位行号（前端零扫描），DOM 节点上限 2000 裁头保内存；换速/暂停前必须 freezeReplayHead 把已过时长折算进播放头防倒退。文件尾部还承载右侧面板（终端助手）的折叠交互与 tab 切换（切到分析/命令面板时触发对应渲染）。",
      "tags": ["replay", "log-viewer", "ui-panel", "performance", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/replay.js:openReplay",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "openReplay",
      "filePath": "web/js/replay.js",
      "lineRange": [12, 35],
      "summary": "打开回放：重置全部状态，调 /api/replay 拉元信息（行数/时长/首尾时间戳）即定播放起点并开始播放；空日志提示后中止。",
      "tags": ["replay", "async", "ui-panel"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/replay.js:_fetchReplayLines",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_fetchReplayLines",
      "filePath": "web/js/replay.js",
      "lineRange": [54, 73],
      "summary": "分页拉取 replayIdx 起的行，只渲染 ts 已到播放头的行并推进 replayIdx；未到播放头的行不渲染也不推进（下次重拉同一页），防行整页跳失。",
      "tags": ["replay", "pagination", "async"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/replay.js:playReplay",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "playReplay",
      "filePath": "web/js/replay.js",
      "lineRange": [88, 99],
      "summary": "requestAnimationFrame 播放循环：按当前播放头更新进度条与时间标签，驱动 _fetchReplayLines 拉行渲染，播到文件尾且 EOF 已到则停止。",
      "tags": ["replay", "animation", "event-loop"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:web/js/search.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "search.js",
      "filePath": "web/js/search.js",
      "summary": "终端搜索与上下文菜单：串口分栏搜索直接在 xterm buffer 内做（后端 buf 的 \\r 处理与 xterm 不同，用后端结果会行号错位），关键字+排除串均走正则（非法降级字面），跳转先关自动跟随、滚动与选区拆帧防 WebGL 重绘竞争；Ctrl+右键菜单含复制选中/全部、粘贴到终端（Win32 原生读剪贴板，多行粘贴需确认防误灌）、清屏。",
      "tags": ["search", "context-menu", "xterm", "clipboard", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/search.js:_pasteToConn",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_pasteToConn",
      "filePath": "web/js/search.js",
      "lineRange": [70, 99],
      "summary": "粘贴到终端：优先 pywebview Win32 原生读剪贴板（绕开 WebView2 权限弹窗），未就绪降级 Web API；多行或超 500 字符弹确认（防误把配置/脚本整段灌进设备），确认后编码为字节 termSendRaw 发送。",
      "tags": ["clipboard", "validation", "win32", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/search.js:doTermSearch",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "doTermSearch",
      "filePath": "web/js/search.js",
      "lineRange": [171, 221],
      "summary": "串口分栏搜索：在 xterm buffer 逐行匹配关键字正则并按 | 分隔的排除正则剔除，渲染命中列表；直接搜用户所见内容，行号与显示一致无错位。",
      "tags": ["search", "xterm", "regex"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/search.js:jumpToTermHit",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "jumpToTermHit",
      "filePath": "web/js/search.js",
      "lineRange": [224, 261],
      "summary": "跳到命中行：先关 autoScroll（防实时流把视口拽回底部），scrollToLine 后下一帧再 select 选中整行 + registerDecoration 高亮（滚动与选区同帧触发会与 WebGL 重绘竞争致半屏空白）；decoration 3 秒后淡出。",
      "tags": ["search", "xterm", "navigation", "rendering"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/search.js:showCtxMenu",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "showCtxMenu",
      "filePath": "web/js/search.js",
      "lineRange": [101, 150],
      "summary": "Ctrl+右键上下文菜单：复制选中/复制全部（遍历 buffer 拼）、粘贴到终端、查找分栏、清屏；定位防溢出右下边界，点击菜单外/滚动/Esc 关闭。",
      "tags": ["context-menu", "clipboard", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:web/js/sidebar.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "sidebar.js",
      "filePath": "web/js/sidebar.js",
      "summary": "侧栏与连接管理：串口/SSH 连接弹窗（类型/认证切换、内联错误显示、全程弹窗内进行防 SSH 等待像卡死）、侧栏打开列表渲染（脏检查 key 变化才重建 DOM，行数只改 textContent）、最近打开列表（后端持久化 + 按类型分组渲染，点击智能分发到对应打开方式）、全局状态与顶栏按钮绑定。",
      "tags": ["sidebar", "connection-management", "ui-panel", "rendering", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/sidebar.js:connectPort",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "connectPort",
      "filePath": "web/js/sidebar.js",
      "lineRange": [41, 56],
      "summary": "建立串口连接：POST /api/connect（kind=serial），成功后 buildTerminal 建 tab、切换激活、刷新侧栏与全局状态，并记入最近打开；异常统一转 {ok:false, err} 由弹窗内联显示。",
      "tags": ["connection-management", "api-client", "serial"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/sidebar.js:connectSSH",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "connectSSH",
      "filePath": "web/js/sidebar.js",
      "lineRange": [58, 76],
      "summary": "建立 SSH 连接：POST /api/connect（kind=ssh，密码或密钥二选一），成功建 tab 并记入最近打开（密码随记录保存供快捷重开免重输）。",
      "tags": ["connection-management", "api-client", "ssh"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/sidebar.js:closeConnection",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "closeConnection",
      "filePath": "web/js/sidebar.js",
      "lineRange": [78, 107],
      "summary": "关闭连接：通知后端 disconnect，释放 SSE/WebGL/xterm 资源与 pending 定时器、移除搜索分栏 document 级监听器防泄漏，切换到剩余第一个 tab 或恢复空状态。",
      "tags": ["connection-management", "cleanup", "resource-management"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/sidebar.js:refreshSidebar",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "refreshSidebar",
      "filePath": "web/js/sidebar.js",
      "lineRange": [109, 181],
      "summary": "刷新侧栏打开列表：按 串口<SSH<日志 排序，脏检查 key（连接集合+活动 tab+标题）变化才重建列表 DOM，未变时只更新各行行数 textContent；tab 栏同序重排，顺序已一致时不动 DOM。",
      "tags": ["rendering", "performance", "sidebar"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/sidebar.js:openRecentItem",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "openRecentItem",
      "filePath": "web/js/sidebar.js",
      "lineRange": [387, 405],
      "summary": "最近打开点击分发：串口/SSH 直接重连；文件按记录的 kind/extPath 分发——hex 走 hex tab、外部路径走 openFileSmart 智能分发、站内文件走 openEditorFile（后端拒收相对名的坑的修复）。",
      "tags": ["dispatcher", "file-management", "recent-items"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:web/js/terminal-core.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "terminal-core.js",
      "filePath": "web/js/terminal-core.js",
      "summary": "终端核心：buildTerminal 用 xterm + Fit/Search/WebLinks/WebGL addon 构建串口/SSH 终端 tab（10 万行回滚缓冲、GPU 渲染失败自动回退、Ctrl+C/V/F 自定义键处理、Ctrl+右键菜单、每连接工具栏——暂停/清屏/新日志/^C/^D/跳底/时间戳注入）；SSE 实时流写入用写合并（攒帧 flush，rAF+500ms 双保险）防高吞吐卡顿；时间戳注入与命令行流式高亮均逐 chunk 状态机实现（不整行缓冲防重复 echo）；termSendRaw 微批 8ms 合并按键。",
      "tags": ["terminal", "xterm", "sse", "performance", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "高吞吐优化范式：xterm.write 每次都有同步解析开销，写合并后渲染次数≈帧率；rAF 在窗口最小化时停发，需 setTimeout 兜底；流式高亮/时间戳必须逐 chunk 扫描且状态跨 chunk 保持——串口命令逐字符 echo，整行缓冲重写会输出重复文本。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/terminal-core.js:buildTerminal",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "buildTerminal",
      "filePath": "web/js/terminal-core.js",
      "lineRange": [1, 257],
      "summary": "构建终端 tab：xterm 实例 + addon 加载（WebGL2 失败回退）、conn 状态对象（暂停/自动跟随/历史分页/搜索分栏/关键字高亮状态）、每连接工具栏事件、onData 输入转字节发送、onScroll 底部检测自动跟随、全屏提示条、COM 号数字排序插 tab、SSE 连接与历史加载。",
      "tags": ["terminal", "xterm", "factory", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/terminal-core.js:switchTab",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "switchTab",
      "filePath": "web/js/terminal-core.js",
      "lineRange": [259, 293],
      "summary": "切换活动 tab：同步 tab 栏/终端区/侧栏高亮，按 kind 分派切换后处理——日志重渲染虚拟列表、编辑器聚焦编辑区、终端双 rAF 后 fit+聚焦（等 display:flex 生效防 0 尺寸）；分析面板可见时刷新一次。",
      "tags": ["navigation", "ui-panel", "tab-management"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/terminal-core.js:appendRaw",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "appendRaw",
      "filePath": "web/js/terminal-core.js",
      "lineRange": [305, 346],
      "summary": "SSE raw 字节流写入终端：历史加载期间先缓冲到 pendingRaw；写合并攒帧 flush（1MB 保险上限同步 flush、rAF+500ms setTimeout 双保险，最小化时仍持续消化队列）；flush 前先命令行高亮再时间戳注入，自动跟随时显式 scrollToBottom 纠偏防底部留白。",
      "tags": ["performance", "sse", "write-merging", "terminal"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/terminal-core.js:_injectTs",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_injectTs",
      "filePath": "web/js/terminal-core.js",
      "lineRange": [355, 373],
      "summary": "逐行时间戳注入（tio 同款）：按 \\n 切分在每个行首插 [HH:MM:SS.mmm]，跨 chunk 行首状态保持（_tsAtLS），行首 \\r 先剥离再放回，全屏应用期间原样透传；字符级控制原样保留。",
      "tags": ["terminal", "timestamps", "streaming"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/terminal-core.js:_hlCmdStream",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_hlCmdStream",
      "filePath": "web/js/terminal-core.js",
      "lineRange": [378, 420],
      "summary": "命令行流式高亮（mobaxterm 风格）：逐 chunk 扫描，遇行首 #/$/> 进命令行态（提示符绿色，后续输入随态染色），\\n/\\r 退出复位；ANSI 控制序列整段透传不改变状态——串口逐字符 echo，不能整行缓冲重写。",
      "tags": ["terminal", "highlighting", "streaming", "state-machine"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/terminal-core.js:termSendRaw",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "termSendRaw",
      "filePath": "web/js/terminal-core.js",
      "lineRange": [450, 467],
      "summary": "发送原始字节：微批合并——连续按键攒 8ms 一批一次 POST（每键一次 fetch 会因 WebView2 网络栈+Flask 线程开销叠加致打字迟缓），8ms 低于感知阈值且不影响命令行完整性。",
      "tags": ["performance", "micro-batching", "api-client"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/terminal-core.js:connectSSE",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "connectSSE",
      "filePath": "web/js/terminal-core.js",
      "lineRange": [469, 489],
      "summary": "建立 /api/stream 的 EventSource：raw 帧走 appendRaw 写入，screenctl 帧切换全屏提示条；onerror 关闭后 2s 重连（校验连接仍存在）。",
      "tags": ["sse", "realtime", "reconnect"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:web/js/tftp.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "tftp.js",
      "filePath": "web/js/tftp.js",
      "summary": "侧栏底部 TFTP/HFS 面板：状态轮询（空闲 2s、传输进行中 0.5s 抓进度，active 用 JS 变量判断不查 DOM 防漏前几秒进度）+ 分区独立脏检查（传输区含进度必刷新、文件区只随集合变化）；合并开关 TFTP 与 HFS 同启同停，HFS 端口内联编辑运行中热重启；目录选择走原生对话框，兜底内联路径输入（WebView2 可能禁 prompt）。",
      "tags": ["tftp", "file-transfer", "polling", "ui-panel", "performance"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/tftp.js:refreshTftp",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "refreshTftp",
      "filePath": "web/js/tftp.js",
      "lineRange": [12, 99],
      "summary": "拉取 /api/tftp/status 与 /api/httpfile/status 刷新面板：开关状态与 HFS 端口显示，传输区（最近 5 条、进行中带进度条，无 total 用不确定条纹动画）与文件区分别 JSON key 脏检查，折叠状态纳入 key，active 传输记录到 JS 变量驱动轮询频率切换。",
      "tags": ["polling", "rendering", "file-transfer", "performance"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/tftp.js:pickTftpDir",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "pickTftpDir",
      "filePath": "web/js/tftp.js",
      "lineRange": [209, 222],
      "summary": "原生目录选择（pywebview js_api，数组形态归一化为字符串，取消即中止不弹输入框），js bridge 不可用时兜底内联路径输入（支持 UNC/网络盘）。",
      "tags": ["file-selection", "fallback", "win32"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    }
  ],
